# real-room-interop: server arguments for 2022-09-24 main yuzu-room.exe (7edc31be2).
# Consumed by: real_room_interop.exe real -Protocol v1 -RoomArgsFile config/yuzu-room.args
# Placeholders substituted per case: {room} {port} {slots} {password} {tag}.
# This build has NO --bind-address option (confirmed by static inventory AND source), so
# Room::Create receives an empty bind address and ENet listens on 0.0.0.0. Real mode
# therefore refuses to start it unless -AllowWildcardBind is given explicitly.
* = --room-name {room} --room-description real-room-interop --preferred-game RealRoomInterop --port {port} --max_members {slots} --password {password}
